can't have a good sandwich! I'm pretty sure you can still buy day old loaves for cheap. (Great for bread pudding!) Next, the straight forward meats and toppings. Nothing too complicated here and you have a three tier system of sandwiches. 8\" Subs #1-#6 are your regular sandwiches. Everything from ham and cheese, to tuna salad or a blt. Feeling extra hungry and want a little more \"oomph\"? Then go for any of ..."},{"business_id":"PnD4caXTlkH-ZRe2xmsh-g","review_id":"ICtadjhLn4Te_5hGHU28Pg","date":"2018-03-17T22:24:21","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9243083000183105,"text_excerpt":"I love jimmy johns, they never disappoint as far as the food. Service could be a little more welcoming. Cookie is awesome! And I love the bread they use for their sandwiches. Oh, and I love the jalapeño chips also!"},{"business_id":"PnD4caXTlkH-ZRe2xmsh-g","review_id":"IzkKXiFz9NQw960e_Gbvmg","date":"2016-02-18T18:33:54","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9170222282409668,"text_excerpt":"Great with a capital G!!!! Accurate ordering. Swift delivery. Friendly delivery people. And the food is good to-boot!!! I had the pleasure of being treated to lunch by my employer; yeah free food. And delivered to us, yessss... But I digress. I ordered the BEACH CLUB (sliced turkey breast provolone cheese avocado spread sliced cucumber lettuce tomato & mayo) tasty tasty treat!!!! The Jimmy John branded chips I selected was Jalapeno Chips & it was a great selection. similar to Zapps but were full of flavor. They also offer cookies & pickles that maybe added to your sub for the full-effect. The delivery guy was super sweet & boasted that he enjoyed the ride down to deliver our sandwiches. F..."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
